SUMMARY:SAPA Stamp Program: Expertising Philatelics (Jimmy Tomchesson)
DESCRIPTION:Jimmy Tomchesson of Philatelic Stamp Authentication and Grading (PSAG) presents 'Expertising Philatelics': how stamps are expertised\, which stamps should be expertised\, and why. Held after the first day of the San Antonio TSDA Stamp Show (October 9-10). Visitors welcome! Doors open at 6:30 PM\, meeting begins at 7:30 PM.
